PLC in LaMoure County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/lamoure-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years, and June to July in 28. In 2025, February to March came in at 46% of normal, and April to May at 138%. So far in 2026, every published pair has come in under 90%, with June to July at 67%.</p>"}
